5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I am curious about the actual lifespan of our recent projects.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I am concerned about the ground conditions and the firms tendering for earth-moving.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mio,,I am worried about the long-term upkeep costs. What will this park actually cost the city to maintain every year?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I need to understand who will actually maintain this park. The staffing rota is shrinking, and I want to know who is left to do the work.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,"The ground dictates the design. I need to know how the drainage and heat actually behave here, not just what the plans promise.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Misaki, earth-moving firms are a good start. I am more interested in what the earlier programme actually delivered.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, the earlier programme is useful, but I need to know if the current firms can handle the ground here.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, that is a great point! If the staff is shrinking, the maintenance bills will skyrocket. I want to see the upkeep ledger to understand the real yearly cost.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, the ledger shows the money, but not the hands. I need to know if the current staff can physically cover the new area.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, the hands matter, but the ground is the first constraint. If the soil cannot drain, no amount of staff fixes the flooding.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, the ground is certainly a constraint, but I suspect the real issue is how we commission these things. I will check the condition of works from the earlier programme.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, I agree. I will check the regional firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes on hoarding the site.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will check the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the groundskeeping roll to see the real maintenance burden.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services. I need to see if we can actually staff the new area or if we are just adding more work to an empty rota.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will check the drainage callouts and August heat readings. I also need the timed counts of weekday crossings to see how people actually move through the space.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Let us see what the records say. The drawings are pretty, but the condition reports tell the truth.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"I will wait for the data. The ground does not lie, but the firms might.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Mio,,I am excited to see the numbers! I hope the ledger is not too scary. Let us find out what this park really costs to keep alive.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I will check the volunteer groups working with the division. If the paid staff is gone, the volunteers are the only remaining option.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,The ground and the people will tell us the truth. Let us see what the data reveals.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
