35,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The basin held, but the apron failed. That gap tells me our commissioning favors spectacle over substance.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The firms flagged clay and slippage. They only quote shallow work. The depot notes say the centre cannot be hoarded. That limits our options significantly.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Mio,,"The ledger is brutal! Planted ground costs triple to maintain, and the gap is widening. With only seven staff left, this is a financial nightmare.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The roll confirms the drop to seven. Bought-in services cover water and turf, but weekend stewarding relies on a casual pool. I need to know if that is sustainable.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The data is clear. Drainage failures doubled, and heat is significantly higher here. People stick to firm ground, avoiding the soft margins.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mio, that triple cost is the smoking gun. We are paying for spectacle that rots. I need to see which candidates avoid that trap.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, spectacle is expensive, but the ground is the real killer. If the centre cannot be hoarded, we are stuck with the clay.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, exactly! If we pick a design with lots of soft ground, the city will bleed money for decades. I need to see which candidates keep the hard surfaces dominant.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, the casual pool is fragile. I found two volunteer groups, but they are tied to specific tasks. I need to know if they can absorb new duties.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, the casual pool is a risk, but the ground is the hard limit. If the soil fails, no volunteer can fix it.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, the ground is a hard limit, but the commissioning process is the soft one. I suspect we keep buying the same failures.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, the process matters, but the clay is immediate. If the centre cannot be hoarded, we are exposed to slippage during the entire build.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, the clay is scary, but the budget is scarier! I am looking for a plan that does not need constant watering or mowing.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Misaki, the clay is a constraint, but the rota is the bottleneck. If we add complex planting, the seven staff cannot cover it.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Misaki, the clay is real, but the drainage data is the warning. We must design for the water, not just the soil.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I am ready to see the candidates. The data suggests we need durability, not decoration.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I am ready. The ground and the firms set the hard limits. Let us see which plan respects them.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Mio,,I am ready! I just want a plan that does not bankrupt the city in three years. Let us see the options!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"I am ready. The staffing data is stark. We need a plan that fits the seven-person reality, not an idealized vision.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minako,,I am ready. The ground and the people have spoken. Let us see which plan respects the water and the crossings.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
