73,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, I agree. A is the only plan that does not demand specialist turf care. The casual pool can handle the stalls. It respects the seven-person limit.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, I agree. The crossing data confirms people want firm ground. A respects the drainage and heat constraints. It is the only plan that works with the reality.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
